Comment: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,理想主義者這麼說
Comment: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:09.63,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,「一個人的出生沒有所謂優劣 人人平等 都有自己存在的價值」
Comment: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,精神主義者這麼高喊
Comment: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:14.42,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,「只要努力就會有收穫」
Comment: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.39,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,「因此就努力去做吧!」
Comment: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.47,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,「過程才是最重要的!」
Comment: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些都是屁話
Comment: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要住在這個城市
Comment: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就連小朋友都知道
Comment: 0,0:00:40.53,0:00:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管在學業上有多麼奮發向上
Comment: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管丟出多少論文
Comment: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到最後這個城市還是只關注能力者
Comment: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有能力的等級才是人的價值所在
Comment: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才是優劣的證明
Comment: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是唯一的指標
Comment: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是所謂的「能力」其實充滿著不確定性
Comment: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先天性的資質造成的影響很大
Comment: 0,0:01:01.15,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於高等級的能力者開發
Comment: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果根本就只是運氣好偶然成功罷了
Comment: 0,0:01:07.54,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就這麼想
Comment: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能不能採取和現行完全不同的方法
Comment: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用全新的研發方法製造出能力者
Comment: 0,0:01:18.78,0:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能不能製造出更安定
Comment: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,更平均的資質
Comment: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用完就算銷毀也不覺得可惜的能力者
Comment: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是否能從零開始製造出來呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就和一群志同道合的夥伴擬定了這個計畫
Comment: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不依靠上帝的偶然 而是製造出必然的能力者的計畫
Comment: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,化合人計畫
Comment: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.53,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fscx88\pos(900,980)}Chemicaloid
Comment: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:42.24,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.17,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這就是... 製造菲布莉她們的理由...
Comment: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,竟然是為了這麼無聊的事情
Comment: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果 妳也是
Comment: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,堅信能力等級主義的人們之中的其中一人嗎?
Comment: 0,0:03:25.31,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和那些傢伙一樣
Comment: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「那些傢伙」...?
Comment: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,以前
Comment: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對於需要化合人技術的人們
Comment: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:32.98,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(929,980)\fscx88}Chemicaloid
Comment: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們曾經提案過這個計畫
Comment: 0,0:03:37.58,0:03:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打著暗部的名號 卻沒什麼本事嘛
Comment: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,居然連我們的計畫的前瞻性都看不出來
Comment: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,能順利通過真是太好了
Comment: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣一來 絕對能力進化計畫
Comment: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.87,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1092,980)}Level 6 Shift
Comment: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就能依照預定規模實施
Comment: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...
Comment: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,木原幻生博士
Comment: 0,0:03:56.70,0:04:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聽到有足以構成威脅的對手時 稍微捏了把冷汗呢
Comment: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,威脅?
Comment: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是那個像是暑期研修計畫一般的那些傢伙啊
Comment: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此明白了一件事情
Comment: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,即使是有名的研究者 也是被能力者等級主義禁錮的守舊派
Comment: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.55,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,具有革新性的想法
Comment: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總是會被視為異端啊
Comment: 0,0:04:23.87,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要被認可 結果只能用實力來證明
Comment: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以我們實際製作出來了
Comment: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,化合人
Comment: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:31.50,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(960,980)\fscx88}Chemicaloid
Comment: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要我們利用她們
Comment: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們有多麼優秀
Comment: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,多麼正確
Comment: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都能向世界證明
Comment: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼
Comment: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你所謂的「優秀」的根據
Comment: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果到底是什麼?
Comment: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些孩子的能力是什麼?
Comment: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳是打算套出情報嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是應該已經給妳們很多線索了喔
Comment: 0,0:04:50.78,0:04:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠端操作...
Comment: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用那根頭髮作為媒介
Comment: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣妳只能得個30分吧
Comment: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不及格喔 超電磁砲
Comment: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:01.25,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1095,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,答案是
Comment: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯
Comment: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等明天妳就會知道了
Comment: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明天早上
Comment: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,伴隨著黎明 揭開我們化合人的大規模公開實驗的序幕
Comment: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:11.66,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(909,980)\fscx88}Chemicaloid
Comment: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗...?
Comment: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,已經不能說是實驗了啊
Comment: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,更正一下
Comment: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是革命!
Comment: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們Study將在這個學園都市掀起革命
Comment: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓這個都市的居民們
Comment: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓世界恍然大悟
Comment: 0,0:05:28.22,0:05:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開創新時代的
Comment: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是能力
Comment: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而是知性啊!
Comment: 0,0:05:33.77,0:05:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為...什麼...
Comment: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,3點...40...
Comment: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳想動也只是白費力氣
Comment: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在的妳 可以動的地方
Comment: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,頂多只有嘴巴和眼球而已
Comment: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Because
Comment: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛才給妳注射的
Comment: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是遮斷神經命令傳達的藥物
Comment: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有兩個小時 妳會連一根手指都沒辦法動
Comment: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,問妳喔 布束
Comment: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...為什麼和那些傢伙混在一起?
Comment: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳之前說過了對吧
Comment: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不認為我的妹妹們是「東西」
Comment: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因此才想讓實驗停止
Comment: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的妳
Comment: 0,0:06:21.35,0:06:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼又在這種地方?
Comment: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在妹妹們的事件中 不小心大意了
Comment: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.00,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(708,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我被暗部的組織抓到了
Comment: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後
Comment: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被賣掉了
Comment: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被賣給Study
Comment: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在那裡 我和人工製造的雙胞胎
Comment: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍妮和菲布莉相遇了
Comment: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聯繫著維持生命的那不自由的大腦活動
Comment: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也就是基本程序
Comment: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是用我以前寫的論文為基礎...
Comment: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,曾犯過一次的罪
Comment: 0,0:06:54.21,0:06:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,永遠無法被原諒
Comment: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如影隨形地追隨著我...
Comment: 0,0:06:58.82,0:06:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,正因為這樣
Comment: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我必須要親自動手
Comment: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,凝視著她們
Comment: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我便產生了這種想法
Comment: 0,0:07:09.71,0:07:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,珍妮
Comment: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布莉的姐姐的體內...
Comment: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只安裝了以「擴散操縱」為核心 正常機能運作所需的程式語言
Comment: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:18.93,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(615,980)\fscx88}Diffusion Ghost
Comment: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,擴散操縱...?
Comment: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.44,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(918,980)\fscx88}Diffusion Ghost
Comment: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是珍妮的能力
Comment: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我本來打算給那孩子
Comment: 0,0:07:25.45,0:07:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,賦予人類的意識
Comment: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在得到中和劑的配方後
Comment: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就一起逃走
Comment: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事已至此
Comment: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這已經是不可能的事情了
Comment: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在只有向製造者本人
Comment: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,從有富那裡問出配方了
Comment: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管用什麼手段
Comment: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會怎麼樣都無所謂
Comment: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些孩子...
Comment: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我絕對要救她們!
Comment: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定會的...
Comment: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在的布束一定...
Comment: 0,0:07:58.40,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:07:59.26,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我做了對不起妳的事...
Comment: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的妹妹們啊
Comment: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說想要和妳道謝
Comment: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在妳想獨自背負一切之前
Comment: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,轉過頭來
Comment: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,睜開雙眼認真地看看吧
Comment: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這裡
Comment: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有著想要幫助妳的人們在啊
Comment: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳不也總是獨自一人背負著嗎?
Comment: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳現在這個樣子又能做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,運動神經被遮斷
Comment: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明只有嘴巴能動...
Comment: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說誰...
Comment: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不能動?
Comment: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼
Comment: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,難道...
Comment: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,自己的運動神經內流竄的電力訊號
Comment: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,直接用能力去控制...?
Comment: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是我第一次嘗試這樣做
Comment: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,結果還算可以呢
Comment: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣子做的話...
Comment: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該全身都會像被刀割般的刺痛...
Comment: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我最近終於明白了
Comment: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,依靠他人
Comment: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被他人依靠
Comment: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有這樣 人類才會...
Comment: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,激發出自己一個人無法發出的力量
Comment: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我也是喔
Comment: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道了妹妹們的事情當時
Comment: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,曾經一個人盲目不知所措
Comment: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是我的錯
Comment: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我必須要做些什麼
Comment: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我現在覺得 這種想法是錯誤的
Comment: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來了呢
Comment: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發生什麼事了?
Comment: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有入侵者
Comment: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,破壞了警備機器人
Comment: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春!
Comment: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,入口已經鎮壓完畢
Comment: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡真的沒有其他居民了吧?
Comment: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會錯的
Comment: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳就放手去做吧
Comment: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天
Comment: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,外面的狀況?
Comment: 0,0:09:45.59,0:09:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒問題
Comment: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目前還沒有可疑的行動
Comment: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼會知道這種地方...
Comment: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我要從學園都市出來外面的時候所使用的
Comment: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,追蹤用奈米裝置
Comment: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後
Comment: 0,0:09:58.04,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我和朋友說好了
Comment: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果我沒有在時間內回去的話 就過來
Comment: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳竟然把朋友捲入...
Comment: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是詳細地和她們說明實情
Comment: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託她們的
Comment: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和她們說「請幫助我」
Comment: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家都毫不猶豫地點頭了
Comment: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說「只要是為了菲布莉」
Comment: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要拯救菲布莉
Comment: 0,0:10:23.36,0:10:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只有我們似乎不夠
Comment: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以拜託妳了
Comment: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把力量借給我們吧
Comment: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我能做的事情...
Comment: 0,0:10:34.39,0:10:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是只有妳才能做到
Comment: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:41.20,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,回答之前
Comment: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有話要對妳說...
Comment: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有話一定要和妳說
Comment: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請救我...
Comment: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託
Comment: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幫助我們...
Comment: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子
Comment: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人!
Comment: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一下 黑子
Comment: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我來救妳妳竟然這樣對我...
Comment: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊...對不起
Comment: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由於某些原因 我要當一陣子的人體電擊棒
Comment: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總而言之
Comment: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先逃出去再說
Comment: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人?
Comment: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,詳細狀況
Comment: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍後再說
Comment: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.95,Default,title,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:22.87,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被注射了那個藥 竟然還能動...
Comment: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:11:27.03,0:11:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然是名副其實的怪物啊
Comment: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 妳為什麼會在這裡?
Comment: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼不逃?
Comment: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Above all
Comment: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,經由暗部間的交易被賣來這裡的我逃走的話
Comment: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼所有的暗部 將成為我的敵人
Comment: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這個城市中 這根本與死無異
Comment: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真不愧是有過切身之痛的人啊
Comment: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過真是太好了
Comment: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果妳逃走了 操縱珍妮的方法...
Comment: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只能揮舞皮鞭控制她了呢
Comment: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:58.29,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,妳的生存之地 只剩黑暗中了
Comment: 0,0:11:59.34,0:12:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳給我牢牢地銘記這點  好好工作吧
Comment: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳真的要留下來嗎?
Comment: 0,0:12:05.98,0:12:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有富他們
Comment: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為要從這裡撤離
Comment: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,將珍妮移到別處去了
Comment: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在離開的話 就無法掌控他們的行蹤了
Comment: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,Never mind
Comment: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還有利用價值
Comment: 0,0:12:19.84,0:12:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會馬上處分我
Comment: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會想辦法跟緊他們
Comment: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,查出他們的根據地 並拿到中和劑的配方
Comment: 0,0:12:27.94,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
